# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF's callback at the safe point. %s is the answer the engineer chose at the relay, as the game shows it; keep the quotation marks round it in your language's style. Avoid a past tense that shows the engineer's gender ("you said", "you found"). Chinese verbs show no gender; WOLF calls the engineer 你 (style guide).
