#. TRANSLATORS: The seal (the red sealed door) is 密封门 everywhere.
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2661
#: scripts/main.gd:2704
msgid "The seal is open. The safe point is just beyond it."
msgstr "密封门开了。安全点就在门后。"

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2667
