msgstr "门炸开时，%s 正站在门前。引信点燃后，要退过阀门。"

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: A knockdown card. %s is the engineer's first name, as an object: keep the name in the nominative (no case ending), and no gendered words about them. TANK RELEASE is a station's name plate. Open glossary term TANK RELEASE: 储罐投放, the style guide's proposal, chosen here; a reviewer's word.
#. i18n: story speaker=narrator engineer=name
#: scripts/story_text.gd:214
